I promised my hon. friend that I would give the total departmental expenditures, unliquidated commitments, and total commitments. Expenditures authorized by statute: $321,267,178.61; unliquidated commitments, none; total commitments authorized by statute, the same amount. To be voted: expenditures, $11,889,820.31; unliquidated commitments, $238,853.53; total commitments, $12,128,673.84.
